<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Our second-annual <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/fusion-2025-replays?utm_source=&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=flywire&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>Flywire Fusion</u></strong></a></span> U.S. education client conference brought together more than 150 higher education partners in Virginia to network, collaborate and get inspired. From Spirit Night to our awards ceremony and innovation hackathon reveal, it was an action-packed experience filled with insightful sessions and discussion—thanks to many of you. Congratulations to this year’s <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/fusion-star-awards-2025-honoring-achievement-and-success-in-us-higher-education?utm_source=flywire&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>star award winners</u></strong></a></span>! Explore our <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/fusion-2025-replays?utm_source=flywire&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>recap videos and session recordings</u></strong></a></span> to see why you should <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://fusion.flywire.com/event/64962232-142e-4223-acb4-7a9cfb76b730?utm_source=flywire&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>join us</u></strong></a></span> in Austin, Texas next October!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
