<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">See how the <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/case-study-university-of-portland-elevates-student-payment-experience-doubling-payment-plan-enrollment?utm_source=flywire&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>University of Portland</u></strong></a> </span>transformed its student payment experience with Flywire SFS—integrated directly with Ellucian Banner—to boost payment plan enrollment by 40% while dramatically reducing staff workload. Check out our case study and video to discover the strategies behind their success and learn how your institution can achieve similar results.</p> </td> 
